 ],
 "captions": [
  {
   "text": "In a grey little",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 1.307,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "town, there was a",
   "start": 1.307,
   "end": 2.377,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "boy who never left",
   "start": 2.377,
   "end": 3.51,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "his room.",
   "start": 3.51,
   "end": 4.076,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Jonah was sick. The",
   "start": 4.776,
   "end": 6.181,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "world outside felt too",
   "start": 6.181,
   "end": 7.808,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "big.",
   "start": 7.808,
   "end": 8.104,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "So he watched all",
   "start": 8.404,
   "end": 9.537,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "of it\u2026 through one",
   "start": 9.537,
   "end": 10.737,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "small window.",
   "start": 10.737,
   "end": 11.604,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then one morning, a",
   "start": 12.704,
   "end": 13.966,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "new girl moved in",
   "start": 13.966,
   "end": 15.095,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "across the alley.",
   "start": 15.095,
   "end": 16.224,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Hi! I'm Ivy!",
   "start": 16.624,
   "end": 18.181,
   "spk": "I"
  },
  {
   "text": "Every day, Ivy drew",
   "start": 19.081,
   "end": 20.448,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "on her window with",
   "start": 20.448,
   "end": 21.743,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "chalk.",
   "start": 21.743,
   "end": 22.175,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Today\u2026 we're going to",
   "start": 22.575,
   "end": 23.991,
   "spk": "I"
  },
  {
   "text": "the ocean.",
   "start": 23.991,
   "end": 24.665,
   "spk": "I"
  },
  {
   "text": "And suddenly, Jonah could",
   "start": 26.081,
   "end": 27.748,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "hear the waves.",
   "start": 27.748,
   "end": 28.748,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Whoa\u2026 is that a",
   "start": 29.148,
   "end": 30.26,
   "spk": "J"
  },
  {
   "text": "whale?",
   "start": 30.26,
   "end": 30.705,
   "spk": "J"
  },
  {
   "text": "After that, Ivy took",
   "start": 32.081,
   "end": 33.581,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "him everywhere.",
   "start": 33.581,
   "end": 34.705,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "A forest full of",
   "start": 35.005,
   "end": 36.463,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "fireflies.",
   "start": 36.463,
   "end": 37.373,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "A city that never",
   "start": 37.673,
   "end": 39.234,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "slept.",
   "start": 39.234,
   "end": 39.785,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Snow on mountains he",
   "start": 40.685,
   "end": 42.156,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "could almost feel.",
   "start": 42.156,
   "end": 43.48,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "For one whole summer,",
   "start": 43.88,
   "end": 45.185,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "they travelled the world.",
   "start": 45.185,
   "end": 46.739,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Without ever leaving home.",
   "start": 47.839,
   "end": 49.737,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then one morning\u2026 Ivy's",
   "start": 53.339,
   "end": 55.081,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "window was empty.",
   "start": 55.081,
   "end": 56.368,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "And the next day.",
   "start": 56.868,
   "end": 58.041,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "And the next.",
   "start": 58.041,
   "end": 58.937,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Her family had moved",
   "start": 60.339,
   "end": 61.731,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "away in the night.",
   "start": 61.731,
   "end": 62.984,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "But on her window\u2026",
   "start": 63.384,
   "end": 64.694,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "was one last drawing.",
   "start": 64.694,
   "end": 66.221,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "An arrow. Pointing out.",
   "start": 67.839,
   "end": 69.499,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "And three words.",
   "start": 69.499,
   "end": 70.655,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Now it's your turn.",
   "start": 71.255,
   "end": 72.663,
   "spk": "I"
  },
  {
   "text": "Jonah pressed his hand",
   "start": 74.839,
   "end": 76.206,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "to the glass. And",
   "start": 76.206,
   "end": 77.262,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "for a long time\u2026",
   "start": 77.262,
   "end": 78.257,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "he just cried.",
   "start": 78.257,
   "end": 79.127,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then, for the first",
   "start": 81.339,
   "end": 82.739,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "time in years\u2026",
   "start": 82.739,
   "end": 83.771,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Jonah opened his door.",
   "start": 84.271,
   "end": 86.319,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "He stepped outside. And",
   "start": 88.339,
   "end": 89.84,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "the whole world was",
   "start": 89.84,
   "end": 91.08,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "waiting.",
   "start": 91.08,
   "end": 91.603,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "He went to see",
   "start": 92.003,
   "end": 92.924,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "every place she gave",
   "start": 92.924,
   "end": 94.239,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "him. For real.",
   "start": 94.239,
   "end": 95.16,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "And on a beach,",
   "start": 96.36,
   "end": 97.412,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "far from that little",
   "start": 97.412,
   "end": 98.816,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "grey town\u2026",
   "start": 98.816,
   "end": 99.517,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "he wrote four words",
   "start": 100.017,
   "end": 101.534,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "in the sand.",
   "start": 101.534,
   "end": 102.492,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Wish you were here.",
   "start": 102.992,
   "end": 104.357,
   "spk": "J"
  },
  {
   "text": "Who gave YOUR world",
   "start": 106.657,
   "end": 108.001,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "color? Tag them.",
   "start": 108.001,
   "end": 109.132,
   "spk": "N"
  }
 ],
